# Frontend

## Styling — NativeWind required
- Use `className` for layout, color, spacing, typography.
- `StyleSheet.create` **only** for shadows/elevation (Android `elevation` + iOS shadow props).
- Map tokens: `bg-bg`, `text-t-1`, `text-gold`, `p-4`, `rounded-md` — see `tailwind.config.js`.
- No raw hex in components; extend `tailwind.config.js` from `src/theme/themes.ts` if missing.

## Screens
- Root wrapper: `SafeAreaView` with `className="flex-1 bg-bg"`.
- Granular Zustand selectors — never `useGameStore(s => s.character)` whole object.
- No game logic in screens — call store actions only.
- Nav types from `RootStackParamList` / `MainTabParamList` in `src/types/index.ts`.

## Components
- Props-driven; no direct store access.
- Export shared primitives via `src/components/index.tsx` barrel.
- `accessibilityLabel` on all `Pressable` / interactive elements.

## Lists & performance
- `FlatList` or `SectionList` for lists > 10 items.
- Haptic feedback on state-changing buttons (`react-native-haptic-feedback`).

## Skill shortcuts
- New screen → `.cursor/skills/frontend/new-screen/SKILL.md`
- StyleSheet migration → `.cursor/skills/frontend/migrate-nativewind/SKILL.md`
